window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>As harsh weather descends on the Texas Hill Country, it’s looking nothing like Christmas at the fort in Ashley Oaks. That is, until Jenni decides the children survivors deserve gifts and a holiday celebration.</p> <p>Christmas during a zombie apocalypse.</p> <p>What can go wrong?</p> <p>This is novelette takes place during Fighting to Survive (As The World Dies Book 2)</p>"; 
